  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "For minimum spherical aberration separation, $d=f_1-f_2=2 \\mathrm{~cm}$\nResultant focal length $=F=10 \\mathrm{~cm}$\nUsing $\\frac{1}{F}=\\frac{1}{f_1}+\\frac{1}{f_2}-\\frac{d}{f_1 f_2}$ and solving, we get $\\mathrm{f}_1, \\mathrm{f}_2 18 \\mathrm{~cm}$ and $20 \\mathrm{~cm}$ respectively.",
